{
  "name": "Fog Cloud",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You create a 20-foot-radius Sphere of fog centered on a point within range. The Sphere is &amp;Reference[heavilyobscured]. It lasts for the duration or until a strong wind (such as one created by <em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplGustofWind]{Gust of Wind}</em>) disperses it.</p><p><strong>Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.</strong> The fog's radius increases by 20 feet for each spell slot level above 1.</p>",
